@startuml claim-state
' 认领申请 ClaimApplication 状态图 · PlantUML 版
' 与 docs/03-设计.md 的认领状态一致
title 认领申请 ClaimApplication 状态图

skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> pending_first : 提交申请
pending_first --> pending_final : 初审建议通过或驳回／老师超时接手
pending_first --> need_more : 初审要求补充
pending_first --> withdrawn : 申请人撤回
need_more --> pending_first : 补交完成（原环节初审）
need_more --> pending_final : 补交完成（原环节终审）
need_more --> withdrawn : 申请人撤回
pending_final --> withdrawn : 申请人撤回
need_more --> rejected : 72 小时未补充
pending_final --> approved : 终审通过
pending_final --> rejected : 终审驳回
pending_final --> need_more : 终审要求补充
approved --> completed : 领取人确认交接
approved --> expired : 逾期且核实未交付
pending_first --> expired : 核实需更正核验信息
pending_final --> expired : 核实需更正核验信息
need_more --> expired : 核实需更正核验信息
completed --> [*]
rejected --> [*]
withdrawn --> [*]
expired --> [*]

note right of approved
  同一时刻同一物品只能有
  一条 approved / pending_* / need_more 记录
  72 小时未确认加入值班待办
end note

@enduml
